        <mxCell id="nb2-v16" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;strokeColor=#000000;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=3;" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Every board has its own adapter and regulator, so no power goes on the ribbon.&lt;br&gt;No UART or I2C between boards. Each signal is 2 GPIO wires = 4 states, and 00 is the safe default. Ribbon: pins 1-2 = main board outputs, pins 3-4 = teammate outputs to main, pins 5-7 not used, pin 8 GND. 100k pull-downs on every input, so an unplugged cable reads 00.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Codes:&lt;/b&gt; Pump 00 stop, 01 run. Weight command 00/01/10/11 = preset 1-4. Weight status 00 not ready, 01 below target, 10 target reached, 11 error. Flow 00 no flow, 01 flowing, 11 sensor fault.&lt;br&gt;Yellow = still needs to be updated by that teammate." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="128" width="610" x="1090" y="-625" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
